`:top

`FT94a3b8For everyone, everywhere.`f

Colorado Mesh (formerly DenverMesh) is a grassroots group of
amateur radio operators, outdoor enthusiasts, hobbyists, and
locals building a resilient, decentralized mesh network with
affordable hardware. No internet or cell towers needed - just
people-powered nodes running `FT86efacMeshtastic`f, `FT22d3eeMeshCore`f,
and `FTf59e0bReticulum`f on 915 MHz LoRa.

